message: "If you use this documentation or its scripts, please cite it as below."
title: "Physical AI with SmolVLA on the SO-ARM101: an end-to-end imitation learning project"
abstract: >-
  Documentation, research notes, tutorials and experiment records for fine-tuning
  the SmolVLA vision-language-action model on teleoperated pick-and-place
  demonstrations collected with an SO-ARM101 arm, ROS 2 Jazzy, ROBOTIS Physical AI
  Tools and LeRobot.
